.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A simple fallback search provider that performs a linear scan over the container and counts how many elements match the given condition\&. 

\fBImportant:\fP This provider does \fBnot\fP return an index\&. It returns the \fBnumber of matches\fP\&. The \fBVectorSearch<T, TContainer>\fP system is designed for complex search algorithms that may evaluate multiple matches, patterns, or conditions\&. It is not a replacement for the traditional \fRFind\fP API\&. 

.PP
\fBPurpose:\fP LinearSearchProvider serves as a universal fallback implementation\&. More advanced providers (binary search, segmented search, pattern matching, domain‑specific logic) should be implemented separately\&. 
.PP
\fBType Constraints\fP
.TP
\fITContainer\fP : \fIIVector<T>\fP
